# Official ruling 2018-04-27 / CR 509.1b: setting a blocked creature's toughness to 1 never unblocks it.
# Turn to Frog makes Gorilla 1/1 after blocks; the block stands, so it dies and deals 1 to the blocker.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Tetsuko Umezawa, Fugitive
Guerrilla Gorilla
Turn to Frog
Island x30

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Guerrilla Gorilla
Forest x30

